{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026BD4jdZNUZ31793609759.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>行政長官李家超明日啟程，前往北京和上海訪問。</p><p></p><p>李家超會先到北京，周三出席第二十九屆京港洽談會開幕式，期間會與北京市官員會面。之後轉往上海，出席第九屆進博會開幕式，會參觀香港展區和香港企業展位，亦會跟與上海官員會面。</p><p></p><p>周五返港，期間由政務司司長陳國基署理行政長官職務。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T09:41:30.979837+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T05:02:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T10:38:22.713272+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T09:38:36.588083+00:00","content_hash":"68aa796a67ec831bd85de66ba9c34e737cf8a8c7853d6ba393b0c85e34848b69","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T09:41:30.979837+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}